6217161133240", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75196225_276217164466573_3774125449967791918_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rqQ3_KeicTQQ7kNvwHGWpgn&_nc_oc=Adm4cMB62wYsgWFHeq_6baoknOINjuMz7FgJzi8P91kr6jY7efqwIyDy_TYRE0pSvWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsQNdq8Fzb05t0X2hDTQBpT3jCs4vs2ZUj6toqNdEH-oQ&oe=69A44CF2"}, {"file_name": "screen5.png", "id": "323855049586279", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75203624_323855056252945_6773569793319638609_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VlcvHYeyy9EQ7kNvwGnwErs&_nc_oc=AdmrFUa4ccUMo57cMixg8a-S1R4HG_2AZa7RNwLSGzdkWM90DIyWKRj0pbUPhHrzVDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftLSuQ9l6rO5ZQtoR_BzvS5alVdalcWnn5bt0Uw6sJsvA&oe=69A44E26"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Da Vinci\u2019s Mysterious GearWorks", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dukedom of Florence, 15th century. Leonardo da Vinci has designed some extraordinary vehicles to solve five situations that afflict the republic: the inventor is recruiting adventurers with the courage to launch them into action.\n\nMaster Leonardo's inventions, such as the eight-pipe organ and the helical boat, and immerse yourself in five different virtual environments to recover ancient artifacts, hunt down robbers and protect the dukedom from enemies!", "short_description": "Dukedom of Florence, 15th century. Leonardo da Vinci has designed some extraordinary vehicles to solve five situations that afflict the republic: the inventor is recruiting adventurers with the courage to launch them into action.\n\nMaster Leonardo's inventions, such as the eight-pipe organ and the helical boat, and immerse yourself in five different virtual environments to recover ancient artifacts, hunt down robbers and protect the dukedom from enemies!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.melazeta.com/app-privacy-leo